@SmartHomeHub_HostAddress = http://localhost:5002

### Retrieve all monitored devices
GET {{SmartHomeHub_HostAddress}}/api/devices
Accept: application/json

### Retrieve device status summary
GET {{SmartHomeHub_HostAddress}}/api/devices/summary
Accept: application/json

### Retrieve all automation workflows
GET {{SmartHomeHub_HostAddress}}/api/workflows
Accept: application/json

### Create a new automation workflow
POST {{SmartHomeHub_HostAddress}}/api/workflows
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Monitor Online Device1",
    "trigger": "interval",
    "condition": "online",
    "deviceName": "Device1",
    "action": "INFO",
    "isEnabled": true
}

###